{"overview":"The Marshal sends John Weston to a rodeo to see if he can find out who is killing the rodeo riders who are about to win the prize money. Barton has organized the rodeo and plans to leave with all the prize money put up by the townspeople. When it appears that Weston will beat Barton's rider, he has his men prepare the same fate for him that befell the other riders.","tagline":"Framed by a gang of murdering thieves!","cast":[{"n":"John Wayne","c":"John Weston","p":"/4VmiGmCwSnratHtYmT2AyXrdQ64.jpg","q":"Q40531"},{"n":"Polly Ann Young","c":"Marjorie Carter","p":"/353XhX3dC8zxf9SYrOVzEQwllPg.jpg","q":"Q3395384"},{"n":"Anita Campillo","c":"Dolores","p":"/x6IBrEaXbySvfoqTRwTRGHsVM6m.jpg","q":"Q21475103"},{"n":"George 'Gabby' Hayes","c":"Marshal George Higgins","p":"/fnTYZNc8Vy7lLJs3xl5GWSHGVSA.jpg","q":"Q1277973"},{"n":"Edward Peil Sr.","c":"Spike Barton (as Edward Peil)","p":"/tkebpmT8PggXYd2Qu028umqEZzc.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Yakima Canutt","c":"Cheyenne Kent","p":"/j1KK4F240wbX1cL7Gg4mVBDKoiq.jpg","q":"Q563665"},{"n":"George Cleveland","c":"Nevada Sheriff","p":"/xD8XBI4Va8HF6fpNpM2C2DHEL5w.jpg","q":"Q3101495"},{"n":"Lafe McKee","c":"Judge Carter","p":"/iDR6BFkx3vJY9dN3LA3bNTAK24J.jpg","q":"Q3216092"},{"n":"Earl Dwire","c":"Rodeo Announcer","p":"/1DZox89bVEBbTC2yu5UBLNCvO6I.jpg","q":"Q5325828"},{"n":"Artie Ortego","c":"Bank Robber","p":"/dBtKab89RoDFAQSDn7Vwub5ru9s.jpg","q":"Q2865765"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Man_from_Utah","qid":"Q1624979"}